 "remarks": "NEW CONSTRUCTION BY RENOWNED WESTPORT LUXURY BUILDER WALTER MATTERA IN THE CHERISHED FLOWER ESTATES NEIGHBORHOOD! An exceptional opportunity to own a brand-new 5-bedroom, 6-full and 2-half-bath luxury residence by Mattera Construction, one of Westport's premier luxury homebuilders, celebrated for timeless architecture, exceptional craftsmanship, and meticulous attention to detail. Set on a beautiful .40-acre property in Westport's desirable Downtown North neighborhood, 22 Fillow Street offers the rare combination of luxury new construction and the warmth and character of an established in-town community. Flower Estates is one of Westport's most cherished neighborhoods, where tree-lined streets, a welcoming atmosphere, and a genuine sense of community create an increasingly sought-after lifestyle. Just minutes from downtown Westport's shops and restaurants, approximately 10 minutes from the Westport train station and Compo Beach, and close to Coleytown Elementary School, the location offers convenience without sacrificing neighborhood charm. Walter Mattera brings his signature commitment to quality, architectural integrity, and thoughtful design to this exciting new residence. With construction just underway, this is a rare opportunity to own a beautifully crafted luxury home by one of Westport's most respected builders in a neighborhood where new construction opportunities are increasingly limited. Timeless craftsmanship. Exceptional location. The best of Westport living.",
